OL,3,ALast Night of the Proms pays tribute to
OL,4,ADolly Parton as classical music
OL,5,Ashowpiece draws to a close
OL,6,
OL,7,FSheridan Smith, Beverley Knight and
OL,8,FWard Thomas pay tribute to Dolly Parton
OL,9,Ffollowing her death last month on the
OL,10,FLast Night of the Proms - "The hair is
OL,11,Fbig, the suit is glittery and the
OL,12,Fatmosphere is jolly - the Queen of
OL,13,FCountry would have loved it"
OL,15,FAfter two months, we have reached the
OL,16,Ffinale of the world's biggest classical
OL,17,Fmusic festival at the Royal Albert Hall
OL,18,Fin London
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
