OL,3,ALast Night of the Proms pays tribute to
OL,4,ADolly Parton as classical music
OL,5,Ashowpiece draws to a close
OL,6,
OL,7,FScottish tenor Nicky Spence gets the
OL,8,Fcrowd "roaring with laughter" as he
OL,9,Fpays many tributes to Scotland - and
OL,10,Fhis costume changes are equally
OL,11,Fimpressive
OL,13,FSuperstar pianist Yuja Wang performs
OL,14,FBarber's epic 26-minute Piano Concerto
OL,15,Fon her return to this venue - it's the
OL,16,Ffirst time the technical masterpiece
OL,17,Fhas been performed at the Proms
